<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said on Friday it would auction 3.0 billion pesos worth of Cetes at the primary auction on May 13.</p>
<p>It will also auction Bondes and UDI, or inflation-indexed,</p>
<p>bonds.</p>
<p>CETES</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    28  days     800 million pesos  18.11 pct</p>
<p>    92  days     800 million pesos  19.48 pct</p>
<p>    182 days     800 million pesos  19.68 pct</p>
<p>    357 days     600 million pesos  18.81 pct</p>
<p>BONDES</p>
<p>    728 days     900 million pesos  100.0 pesos</p>
<p>UDIBONOS</p>
<p>    1,092 days   250 million UDIs   100 pesos</p>
<p>    1,820 days   250 million UDIs   100 pesos</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
